# Assets

## entry.js

```js
"use 1";
"use 2";
"use 3";
(function() {
	//#region nested.js
	//! A
	//! B
	//! C
	nested();
	//! D
	//! E
	//! F
	//#endregion
	//#region entry.js
	//! 1
	//! 2
	//! 3
	entry();
	//! 4
	//! 5
	//! 6
	//#endregion
})();

```
